<?XML version='1.0' ?>
<!--
	RVP Default, RVP's own skin (milestone M7), in PotPlayer's skin format.
	The layout and the commands follow the classic PotPlayer window on
	purpose, so habits carry over; every picture, colour and font is drawn
	for RVP (SOURCES.md lists them). crates/look builds the skin: it draws
	the sprites of sprites.xml into the atlases and fills in the
	placeholders in braces, a sprite name followed by .x and .y (its place
	in the atlas), .w and .h (one cell or button state) or .tw (all cells).
-->
